L604: Title: The effects of endogenously- and exogenously-induced hyperketonemia on exercise performance and adaptation (Supplementary Information)
L605: David J. Dearlove1 (david.dearlove@ocdem.ox.ac.uk), Adrian Soto Mota1 (adsotomota@gmail.com), David Hauton2 (davehauton@gmail.com), Katherine Pinnick3 (katherine.pinnick@ocdem.ox.ac.uk), Rhys Evans1 (rhys.evans@dpag.ox.ac.uk), Roman Fischer4 (roman.fischer@ndm.ox.ac.uk), James S.O. Mccullagh2 (james.mccullagh@chem.ox.ac.uk). Leanne Hodson3 (leanne.hodson@ocdem.ox.ac.uk), Kieran Clarke1 (kieran.clarke@dpag.ox.ac.uk), Pete J. Cox1 (petejcox456@gmail.com)
